  "description": "Forced into a two-year contract marriage in place of her stepsister, who fell into a coma after an accident,\n\nGeunyung agrees—under one condition.\n\n[Special Clause: The contract ends if Lee Hyunjoo wakes up.]\n\nThey were just a couple on paper.\n\nA temporary arrangement.\n\nBut everything starts to unravel when her husband, Tae Lee-Geon, begins to change.\n\n\"How about we actually get all over each other tonight?\"\n\nIn the midst of confusion, fear, and a whirlwind of emotions,\n\nGeunyeong finds herself heading toward the inevitable end of this marriage.\n\n\"Lee-Geon, you win. let's do it.\"\n\nFor the sake of a new beginning\n\n**Original Webtoon:**      \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12511265)     \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12511263) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \nR15: [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004034)",
